    "_note": "Deity-names are phoneme-morphs of the canonical (Agrippan) pantheon through Latinate-Iberian phonology (-o/-us endings, Romance shifts) \u2014 recognizably the same powers, never real Iberian gods. Lawful/Neutral; Roman state-cult forms over Iberian ancestral/mountain veneration.",
