    },
    "demon_epithet_pattern": "each opposing power keeps its morphed name + a portfolio epithet (prefix 'o falso' or suffix '-tyranno'), distinct per power: Maraxus -> Maraxo the Burning Tyrant; Lusento -> Lusento the Coin-Serpent; Irantius -> Irancio the Restless.",
